==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Raichu|50}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Raichu}}.
*{{m|Thunder}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Raichu}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

